    "text": "<p>Thermal decomposition of lead nitrate gives nitrogen dioxide.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Pb</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><munder><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi></mover><mrow><mn>673</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></munder><mn>2</mn><mi>PbO</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi>Dimerisation</mi></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4f20aa04-1e44-47e5-af43-f650603b709a-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 168px;\" /></p>",
